{
  "description": "dsh-turn-process-open 依赖的上游事实：轮次过程标题的 DOM 锚点（含 aria-expanded 同元素渲染）、Chat 渲染器的 turnProcess / actions 写入口、主会话槽位与会话作用域标记，以及折叠工作步骤与阅读位置补偿读取的聊天行 / 轮次 / 跟随尾部 / 上游动画 / 封口锚点。本目录的 check-css.mjs 逐条校验（由 pnpm check:css 触发，不挂在 pnpm build 上）：这些事实被改名 / 搬走时，插件会静默退化成 no-op、合成点击或直接折叠；这里把那种退化提前变成一次显式失败，并在 hint 里写明后果。",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "turn-process-control",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "轮次过程标题标记消失：锁定器与折叠键都认不出标题，插件空转（自动折叠恢复，折叠键收不到整段过程）"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-aria-expanded",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process\":[\\s\\S]{0,600}\"aria-expanded\"",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "标题上的 aria-expanded 不再与 data-turn-process 同元素渲染：锁定器认不出可折标题，插件空转（不拦点击），新消息到达时上游照常折叠整轮"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-chevron-icon",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process\":[\\s\\S]{0,1100}?IconChevronDownOutlineRegular",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "标题按钮不再把展开箭头图标渲染成自己的子节点：`> svg` 那条锚点落空（`_chevron` 通配符仍可兜底），锁定标题右侧的向上箭头会重新出现"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-chevron-class",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "TurnProcessNodeView_module_css_default\\s*=\\s*\\{[\\s\\S]{0,300}?\"chevron\":\\s*\"[\\w-]+_chevron\"",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "TurnProcessNodeView 的 chevron 局部类名变了（生成名形如 l_V-RG_chevron，构建只换前缀）：[class*=\"_chevron\"] 那条锚点落空，只剩 `> svg` 兜底；两条同时失效时锁定标题右侧的箭头重新出现"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-message-count",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process-messages\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "轮次消息计数属性改名：观察者不再因内容更新重新 seed；运行中 answerStep 变化时锁定可能延迟一拍，但已写入的记录仍生效"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-tool-calls",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process-tool-calls\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "工具调用计数属性改名：同 turn-process-message-count，锁定本身不受影响"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-subagents",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-turn-process-subagents\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "子代理计数属性改名：同 turn-process-message-count，锁定本身不受影响"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-prop",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "spec:\\s*processSpec,[\\s\\S]{0,240}setOpen",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "TurnProcessNodeView 的 turnProcess prop 形状变了：fiber 读不到 spec / setOpen，退化为折叠后合成点击（新消息到达时可能先折一下再展开）"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-answer-step",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "answerStep: number",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib/types/client/contract"
      ],
      "hint": "TurnProcessSpec.answerStep 类型变了：写入记录的 answerStep 可能与 spec 不再匹配，锁定退化为记录不生效（与未装插件相同）"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-set-open",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "setOpen\\(open: boolean\\)",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib/types/client/contract"
      ],
      "hint": "TurnProcessOwnerProps.setOpen 改名：fiber 的 setOpen 降级路径不可用；若 actions 仍可用则不受影响，否则退化为合成点击"
    },
    {
      "id": "turn-process-store-action",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "setTurnProcessOpen",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib/types/client"
      ],
      "hint": "Chat store 的 setTurnProcessOpen 改名：无法绕过 alwaysOpen 预写记录，退化为 setOpen(true) / 合成点击；运行中轮次可能先折一下"
    },
    {
      "id": "main-conversation-slot",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "\"main.conversation\"",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-conversation/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "主会话槽位名变了：锁定器与折叠键找不到主会话作用域；回退只在全文档恰好有一个消息滚动口时生效，否则不动作（不误锁右栏）"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot-anchor-wraps-content",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-slot\":[\\s\\S]{0,240}children:",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-renderer/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "槽位锚点不再包裹槽位内容：main.conversation 的元素不再包含会话 DOM，锁定器找不到滚动口；回退只在全文档恰好有一个滚动口时生效，否则不动作"
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation-scroll",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "data-conversation-scroll",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-conversation/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "消息滚动口标记消失：找不到主会话的标题集合，插件空转（不误锁右栏）"
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation-session",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "data-conversation-session",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-conversation/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "会话根标记消失：去重键里的 sessionId 退化为空串；切换会话后同一 turn/answerStep 的标题可能被当成同一代而跳过重写，锁定延迟到标题再次折叠才恢复"
    },
    {
      "id": "process-group-header",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-process-activity\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "过程组标题标记消失：折叠键收不到「执行了命令，已读取文件」这类组标题；详细模式下单独展开的组不会随快捷键收起"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-process-root",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-step-process\":\\s*true",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "过程组根标记消失：折叠键认不出过程组容器，点不到组标题，也不再限定单步详情的归属"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-flow-kind",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-chat-flow-kind\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "聊天流节点种类标记消失：完全展开模式下分不清工具 / 助手步骤与系统提示词，单步详情折叠会失效或误折非步骤内容"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-disclosure-row",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "\"data-disclosure-row\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-web-frontend/dist/assets"
      ],
      "hint": "共享折叠行标记消失（思考 / 文件 / 搜索等单步详情）：外层已经收起后再按一次不会收起这些单步详情"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-expandable",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "\"data-expandable\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-tool/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "工具行 / 命令输出的可展开标记消失：完全展开模式下展开着的单步详情不会被快捷键收起"
    },
    {
      "id": "composer-seat",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "data-composer-seat",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-conversation/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "composer 座位标记消失：阅读位置补偿算不出可见带下边界，夹在 composer 后面的行可能被误判在视口内"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-flow-row",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-chat-flow-key\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "聊天行标记消失：折叠后的阅读线找不到行锚点，锚点滚动补偿退化为 no-op（折叠本身仍生效）"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-flow-turn",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-chat-turn\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "轮次归属标记消失：封口认不出最新锁轮次，锚点也分不清行属于哪一轮；折叠本身仍生效"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-following-tail",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "data-chat-following-tail",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "跟随尾部标记消失：在会话底部折叠时也会做阅读线补偿，把视图从底部拉开"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat-motion",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "token": "data-chat-motion",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "上游折叠动画标记消失：认不出上游正在做帧补偿，可能和它的阅读位置保持叠加成二次滚动"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-expanded-mode",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-group-expanded-mode\":",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "平铺模式标记消失：封口认不出最新一轮的平铺组，折叠后保持平铺（不丢内容；与下一条消息到达时的形态不一致）"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-process-body",
      "plugin": "dsh-turn-process-open",
      "pattern": "\"data-step-process-body\":\\s*true",
      "paths": [
        "dsh-client-ui-chat/lib"
      ],
      "hint": "过程组滚动体标记消失：封口的隐藏成员规则落空，只显示组头 / 成员仍平铺（退化，不丢内容）"
    }
  ]
}
